# pseudocode source: chapters/ch88.tex:116
# caption: Compute a minimum additive target cover for a finite expression tree.

REQUIRE tree, finite legal target patterns, additive nonnegative costs, result categories
ENSURE minimum-cost cover within this tree grammar
FORALL nodes in postorder DO
  FORALL target patterns matching this node DO
    obtain required categories and best costs at the pattern frontier
    add frontier costs to this target rule's cost
    retain the cheapest feasible cover for each produced category
  END FOR
END FOR
reconstruct the selected root cover through recorded backpointers

